  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gal 503.09 Communication of Information About Services and Qualifications. A guardian ad litem shall not knowingly misrepresent his or her experience, education, certifications, or skills.\n\nSource. #8941, eff 9-15-07, EXPIRED: 9-15-15\n\nNew. #11075, INTERIM, eff 4-18-16, EXPIRED: 10-15-16\n\nNew. #12010, eff 10-21-16",
